# BuildKit reads "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile.
# Patterns are relative to the build context, which is the workspace root that
# holds several sibling clones (compose: "context: .."; CI: the "source" dir).
# A <context>/.dockerignore would not be versioned in this repository.

# Send only what the Dockerfile copies.
*
!shared-sdk-client/typescript
!microservice-wordpass/src

# Never send these, wherever they are.
**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.env.secrets
**/*.secrets.env
**/*service-account*.json
**/tests
**/docs
**/*.md
**/.vscode
**/.idea
